Here is the source code for the **Spend Trajectory** chart found in `components/Dashboard.tsx`.

This consists of two parts:
1.  **Data Preparation (`lineChartData`)**: Calculates the cumulative daily spend for the current month vs. the previous period.
2.  **Chart Rendering (`ComposedChart`)**: The visual implementation using Recharts.

### 1. Data Logic
This `useMemo` hook transforms your raw transaction list into cumulative daily data points.

```typescript
const lineChartData = useMemo(() => {
  const daysInCurrentMonth = new Date(currentYear, currentMonth + 1, 0).getDate();
  const data = [];

  // Helper to calculate daily cumulative spend for a specific month/year
  const getDailySpend = (month: number, year: number) => {
      const daily = new Array(32).fill(0);
      transactions.forEach(t => {
          const d = new Date(t.date);
          // Filter: Expense only, match specific month/year
          if (t.type === TransactionType.EXPENSE && d.getMonth() === month && d.getFullYear() === year) {
              daily[d.getDate()] += t.amount;
          }
      });
      // Cumulative Sum Algorithm (Bring data points together)
      for (let i = 1; i < daily.length; i++) daily[i] += daily[i-1];
      return daily;
  };

  // Get data for this month
  const currentMonthData = getDailySpend(currentMonth, currentYear);

  // Get comparison data (Previous Month or Previous Year)
  let comparisonData: number[] = [];
  if (spendingComparison === 'year') {
      comparisonData = getDailySpend(currentMonth, currentYear - 1);
  } else {
      let prevMonth = currentMonth - 1;
      let prevYear = currentYear;
      if (prevMonth < 0) { prevMonth = 11; prevYear = currentYear - 1; }
      comparisonData = getDailySpend(prevMonth, prevYear);
  }

  // Combine into chart-friendly format
  for (let i = 1; i <= daysInCurrentMonth; i++) {
      data.push({
          day: i,
          ThisMonth: currentMonthData[i],
          Comparison: comparisonData[i] 
      });
  }
  return data;
}, [transactions, currentMonth, currentYear, spendingComparison]);
```

### 2. Visualization Code
This JSX renders the chart. It uses an `<Area>` component for the current month to create the filled "brought together" look, and a `<Line>` for the comparison.

```tsx
{/* Spend Trajectory Chart Container */}
<div className="md:col-span-2 glass-card p-6 md:p-8 rounded-[2.5rem] border border-white/5 bg-[#0f172a] flex flex-col relative overflow-visible h-[32rem]">

    {/* Header & Legend */}
    <div className="flex flex-col md:flex-row justify-between items-start md:items-center mb-8 relative z-50">
        <div>
            <h3 className="text-xl font-bold text-white tracking-tight">Spend Trajectory</h3>
            <p className="text-sm text-slate-400 font-medium mt-1">Cumulative spending vs previous month</p>
        </div>
        <div className="flex items-center gap-6 mt-4 md:mt-0">
             <div className="flex items-center gap-2">
                <div className="w-2.5 h-2.5 rounded-full bg-[#6366f1] shadow-[0_0_8px_#6366f1]"></div>
                <span className="text-[10px] font-bold text-slate-300 uppercase tracking-widest">Current</span>
            </div>
            <div className="flex items-center gap-2">
                <div className="w-2.5 h-2.5 rounded-full bg-slate-600"></div>
                <span className="text-[10px] font-bold text-slate-500 uppercase tracking-widest">Previous</span>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>

    {/* Actual Chart Component */}
    <div className="flex-1 w-full min-h-0 relative z-10">
        <ResponsiveContainer width="100%" height="100%">
            <ComposedChart data={lineChartData} margin={{ top: 20, right: 30, left: 10, bottom: 40 }}>
                <defs>
                    {/* Gradient Definition for the Area Fill */}
                    <linearGradient id="colorThisMonth" x1="0" y1="0" x2="0" y2="1">
                        <stop offset="5%" stopColor="#6366f1" stopOpacity={0.5}/>
                        <stop offset="95%" stopColor="#6366f1" stopOpacity={0.05}/>
                    </linearGradient>
                </defs>
                <CartesianGrid strokeDasharray="3 3" vertical={false} stroke="rgba(255,255,255,0.05)" />
                <XAxis 
                    dataKey="day" 
                    stroke="#475569" 
                    fontSize={11} 
                    tickLine={false} 
                    axisLine={false} 
                    dy={10}
                    tick={{ fill: '#64748b', fontWeight: '500' }}
                    interval="preserveStartEnd"
                    padding={{ left: 20, right: 20 }}
                />
                <YAxis 
                    stroke="#475569" 
                    fontSize={11} 
                    tickLine={false} 
                    axisLine={false} 
                    tickFormatter={(val) => isPrivacyMode ? '•••' : `$${val}`}
                    tickCount={7}
                    width={40}
                    tick={{ fill: '#64748b', fontWeight: '500' }}
                />
                <Tooltip content={<CustomChartTooltip formatCurrency={formatCurrency} />} cursor={{ stroke: 'rgba(255,255,255,0.1)', strokeWidth: 1 }} />

                {/* Previous Period Line (Dotted) */}
                <Line 
                    type="monotone" 
                    dataKey="Comparison" 
                    stroke="#475569" 
                    strokeWidth={2} 
                    dot={false} 
                    strokeDasharray="4 4" 
                    activeDot={false}
                />
                {/* Current Period Area (Filled Gradient) */}
                <Area 
                    type="monotone" 
                    dataKey="ThisMonth" 
                    stroke="#6366f1" 
                    strokeWidth={3} 
                    fill="url(#colorThisMonth)"
                    dot={false}
                    activeDot={{ r: 6, strokeWidth: 0, fill: '#6366f1' }}
                />
            </ComposedChart>
        </ResponsiveContainer>
    </div>
</div>

