                                            <stop offset="95%" stopColor="#6366f1" stopOpacity={0.05}/>
                                        </linearGradient>
                                    </defs>
                                    <CartesianGrid strokeDasharray="3 3" vertical={false} stroke="rgba(255,255,255,0.05)" />
                                    <XAxis 
                                        dataKey="day" 
                                        stroke="#475569" 
                                        fontSize={11} 
                                        tickLine={false} 
                                        axisLine={false} 
                                        dy={15} 
                                        tick={{ fill: '#64748b', fontWeight: '500' }}
                                        interval={2} 
                                        padding={{ left: 10, right: 10 }}
                                    />
                                    <YAxis 
                                        stroke="#475569" 
                                        fontSize={11} 
                                        tickLine={false} 
                                        axisLine={false} 
                                        tickFormatter={(val) => isPrivacyMode ? '•••' : `$${val}`}
                                        tickCount={6}
                                        width={70} 
                                        dx={-10}  
                                        tick={{ fill: '#64748b', fontWeight: '500' }}
                                    />
                                    <Tooltip 
                                        content={<CustomChartTooltip formatCurrency={formatCurrency} />} 
                                        cursor={{ stroke: 'rgba(255,255,255,0.1)', strokeWidth: 1 }} 
                                    />

                                    {/* Previous Period Line */}
                                    <Line 
                                        type="monotone" 
                                        dataKey="Comparison" 
                                        stroke="#475569" 
                                        strokeWidth={2} 
                                        dot={false} 
                                        strokeDasharray="4 4" 
                                        activeDot={false}
                                    />
                                    {/* Current Period Line */}
                                    <Area 
                                        type="monotone" 
                                        dataKey="ThisMonth" 
                                        stroke="#6366f1" 
                                        strokeWidth={3} 
                                        fill="url(#colorThisMonth)"
                                        dot={false}
                                        activeDot={{ r: 6, strokeWidth: 0, fill: '#6366f1' }}
                                    />
                                </ComposedChart>
                            </ResponsiveContainer>
                        </div>
                    </div>

                    {/* New Insight Card (1/3 width) */}
                    <div className="glass-card p-6 rounded-[2.5rem] border border-white/5 bg-slate-900/60 flex flex-col justify-between relative overflow-hidden">
                        <div className="absolute top-0 right-0 w-32 h-32 bg-indigo-500/5 rounded-full blur-[60px] pointer-events-none"></div>

                        <div className="relative z-10">
                            <div className="flex items-center gap-2 mb-6">
                                <div className={`p-2 rounded-lg ${spendingInsight.isIncrease ? 'bg-rose-500/10 text-rose-400' : 'bg-emerald-500/10 text-emerald-400'}`}>
                                    {spendingInsight.isIncrease ? <TrendingUp className="w-4 h-4" /> : <TrendingDown className="w-4 h-4" />}
                                </div>
                                <h3 className="text-sm font-black text-white uppercase tracking-widest">Spending Insight</h3>
                            </div>

                            <div className="space-y-1">
                                {spendingInsight.hasData ? (
                                    <>
                                        <p className="text-[10px] text-slate-500 font-bold uppercase tracking-wider">Comparison</p>
                                        <div className="flex items-baseline gap-2">
                                            <span className={`text-4xl font-black tracking-tighter ${spendingInsight.isIncrease ? 'text-rose-400' : 'text-emerald-400'}`}>
                                                {spendingInsight.percent}%
                                            </span>
                                            <span className={`text-sm font-bold uppercase tracking-wide ${spendingInsight.isIncrease ? 'text-rose-500' : 'text-emerald-500'}`}>
                                                {spendingInsight.isIncrease ? 'More' : 'Less'}
                                            </span>
                                        </div>
                                        <p className="text-xs text-slate-400 font-medium mt-2 leading-relaxed">
                                            You've spent {spendingInsight.percent}% {spendingInsight.isIncrease ? 'more' : 'less'} this month compared to last month. {formatCurrency(spendingInsight.diff)} difference.
                                        </p>
                                    </>
                                ) : (
                                    <div className="flex flex-col items-center justify-center h-24 text-center opacity-50">
                                        <Activity className="w-8 h-8 text-slate-600 mb-2" />
                                        <p className="text-xs font-bold text-slate-500">Not enough data for previous month comparison.</p>
                                    </div>
                                )}
                            </div>
                        </div>

                        {spendingInsight.hasData && (
                            <div className="relative z-10 mt-6 pt-6 border-t border-white/5">
                                <div className="flex items-center gap-2 text-[10px] font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-slate-500">
                                    {spendingInsight.isIncrease ? (
                                        <>
                                            <AlertCircle className="w-3 h-3 text-amber-500" />
                                            <span>Check Budget</span>
                                        </>
                                    ) : (
                                        <>
                                            <CheckCircle2 className="w-3 h-3 text-emerald-500" />
                                            <span>On Track</span>
                                        </>
                                    )}
                                </div>
                            </div>
                        )}
                    </div>
                </div>

            </div>

            {/* RIGHT SIDEBAR */}
            <div className="lg:col-span-4 flex flex-col gap-6 h-full">

                {/* Goal Vector - Redesigned Grid */}
                <div className="glass-card p-6 rounded-[2.5rem] border border-white/5 bg-slate-900/40 flex flex-col gap-6">
                    {/* Header */}
                    <div className="flex justify-between items-center">
                        <div className="flex items-center gap-3">
                            <div className="w-10 h-10 rounded-full bg-rose-500/10 flex items-center justify-center border border-rose-500/20 shadow-[0_0_15px_rgba(244,63,94,0.2)]">
                                <Target className="w-5 h-5 text-rose-500" />
                            </div>
                            <div>
                                <h3 className="text-sm font-black text-white uppercase tracking-wider">Goal Vector</h3>
                                <p className="text-[10px] text-slate-500 font-bold uppercase tracking-widest">Financial Velocity</p>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                        <button
                            onClick={() => onNavigate('goals')}
                            className="flex items-center gap-2 px-3 py-1.5 rounded-lg bg-emerald-500/10 hover:bg-emerald-500/20 border border-emerald-500/20 text-emerald-400 text-[10px] font-black uppercase tracking-widest transition-all"
                        >
                            <Plus className="w-3 h-3" /> New Goal
                        </button>
                    </div>

                    {/* Limits Row */}
                    <div className="grid grid-cols-2 gap-3">
                        {/* Global Limit */}
                        <div className="bg-[#020617] rounded-2xl p-4 border border-white/5 relative overflow-hidden group hover:border-white/10 transition-colors">
                             <div className="flex justify-between items-start mb-4">
                                 <span className="text-[9px] font-black text-slate-500 uppercase tracking-widest">Global Limit</span>
                                 <CircularProgress percentage={goalMetrics.budgetUtilization} color="#f59e0b" />
                             </div>
                             <div className="relative z-10">
                                 <div className="text-lg font-black text-amber-400">{formatCurrency(currentPeriodSpend)}</div>
                                 <div className="text-[9px] font-bold text-slate-600">/ {formatCurrency(displayLimit)}</div>
                             </div>
                        </div>

                        {/* Category Limit */}
                        <div className="bg-[#020617] rounded-2xl p-4 border border-white/5 relative overflow-hidden group hover:border-white/10 transition-colors">
                             {highlightedBudgetMetrics ? (
                                 <>
                                    <div className="flex justify-between items-start mb-4">
                                        <span className="text-[9px] font-black text-slate-500 uppercase tracking-widest truncate max-w-[80px]">{highlightedBudgetMetrics.category}</span>
                                        <CircularProgress percentage={highlightedBudgetMetrics.percentage} color="#3b82f6" />
                                    </div>
                                    <div className="relative z-10">
                                        <div className="text-lg font-black text-white">{formatCurrency(highlightedBudgetMetrics.spent)}</div>
                                        <div className="text-[9px] font-bold text-slate-600">/ {formatCurrency(highlightedBudgetMetrics.limit)}</div>
                                    </div>
                                 </>
                             ) : (
                                 <div className="h-full flex flex-col items-center justify-center text-center opacity-50">
                                     <span className="text-[9px] font-bold text-slate-500 uppercase">No Budget Set</span>
                                 </div>
                             )}
                        </div>
                    </div>

                    {/* Total Savings */}
                    <div className="bg-[#020617] rounded-2xl p-4 border border-white/5 flex justify-between items-center relative overflow-hidden group hover:border-white/10 transition-colors">
                        <div>
                            <span className="text-[9px] font-black text-slate-500 uppercase tracking-widest block mb-1">Total Savings</span>
                            <div className="flex items-baseline gap-1">
                                <span className="text-xl font-black text-emerald-400">{formatCurrency(goalMetrics.totalSaved)}</span>
                                <span className="text-[9px] font-bold text-slate-600">/ {formatCurrency(goalMetrics.totalTarget)}</span>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                        <CircularProgress percentage={goalMetrics.savingsProgress} color="#10b981" />
                    </div>

                    {/* Active Goals */}
                    {displayGoals.length > 0 && (
                        <div>
                            <div className="text-[9px] font-black text-emerald-500 uppercase tracking-widest mb-3 opacity-90 pl-1">Active Goals</div>
                            <div className="grid grid-cols-2 gap-3">
                                {displayGoals.map((goal, idx) => {
                                    const progress = Math.min((goal.currentAmount / goal.targetAmount) * 100, 100);
                                    const isEven = idx % 2 === 0;
                                    return (
                                        <div key={goal.id} className="bg-[#020617] rounded-2xl p-4 border border-white/5 relative overflow-hidden flex flex-col justify-between min-h-[100px] group hover:border-white/10 transition-colors">
                                            <div className="flex justify-between items-start mb-2">
                                                <span className="text-[10px] font-black text-slate-400 uppercase tracking-wider truncate max-w-[80px]">{goal.name}</span>
                                                {isEven ? <Check className="w-3 h-3 text-emerald-500" /> : <Shield className="w-3 h-3 text-indigo-500" />}
                                            </div>
                                            <div>
                                                <div className={`text-lg font-black mb-3 ${isEven ? 'text-emerald-400' : 'text-indigo-400'}`}>{formatCurrency(goal.currentAmount)}</div>
                                                <div className="h-1 w-full bg-slate-800 rounded-full overflow-hidden">
                                                    <div 
                                                        className={`h-full rounded-full ${isEven ? 'bg-emerald-500' : 'bg-indigo-500'}`} 
                                                        style={{ width: `${progress}%` }}
                                                    ></div>
                                                </div>
                                            </div>
                                        </div>
                                    )
                                })}
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    )}

                    {/* Simulate Button */}
                    <button 
                        onClick={() => onNavigate('smart_money', { tab: 'sandbox' })}
                        className="w-full py-4 bg-gradient-to-r from-indigo-600 to-indigo-500 hover:from-indigo-500 hover:to-indigo-400 text-white rounded-2xl text-[10px] font-black uppercase tracking-[0.2em] shadow-lg shadow-indigo-500/20 active:scale-95 transition-all flex items-center justify-center gap-3 mt-2"
                    >
                        <Microscope className="w-4 h-4" /> Simulate My Goal
                    </button>
                </div>

                {/* Actions & Credit Score Split */}
                <div className="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-4 items-stretch">
                    {/* Left Column: Navigation Buttons (Span 2) */}
                    <div className="md:col-span-2 flex flex-col gap-3 justify-between h-full">

                        {/* 1. Overview Dropdown */}
                        <div className="relative w-full group">
                            <button 
                                onClick={(e) => toggleMenu(e, 'overview_menu')}
                                className="w-full p-5 bg-slate-900/40 border border-white/5 text-slate-300 rounded-3xl text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-widest flex justify-between items-center hover:bg-slate-800 hover:text-white transition-all shadow-sm"
                            >
                                <span className="flex items-center gap-3"><FileText className="w-4 h-4 text-slate-500" /> Financial Overview</span>
                                <ChevronDown className={`w-4 h-4 text-slate-500 transition-transform ${activeMenu === 'overview_menu' ? 'rotate-180' : ''}`} />
                            </button>
                            {activeMenu === 'overview_menu' && (
                                <div className="absolute top-full left-0 right-0 mt-2 bg-slate-950 border border-white/10 rounded-2xl shadow-xl z-30 overflow-hidden animate-fade-in p-1">
                                    <button onClick={() => { onNavigate('insights', { reportType: 'monthly' }); setActiveMenu(null); }} className="w-full text-left px-4 py-3 text-[10px] font-bold text-slate-300 hover:bg-white/5 hover:text-white rounded-xl flex items-center gap-3 uppercase tracking-wider">
                                        <FileText className="w-3 h-3 text-emerald-400" /> Monthly Report
                                    </button>
                                    <button onClick={() => { onAskCoach && onAskCoach(""); setActiveMenu(null); }} className="w-full text-left px-4 py-3 text-[10px] font-bold text-slate-300 hover:bg-white/5 hover:text-white rounded-xl flex items-center gap-3 uppercase tracking-wider">
                                        <UserCircle className="w-3 h-3 text-indigo-400" /> Question Coach
                                    </button>
                                </div>
                            )}
                        </div>

                        {/* 2. Tools Dropdown */}
                        <div className="relative w-full group">
                            <button 
                                onClick={(e) => toggleMenu(e, 'tools_menu')}
                                className="w-full p-5 bg-slate-900/40 border border-white/5 text-slate-300 rounded-3xl text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-widest flex justify-between items-center hover:bg-slate-800 hover:text-white transition-all shadow-sm"
                            >
                                <span className="flex items-center gap-3"><Sparkles className="w-4 h-4 text-amber-500" /> Smart Money Tools</span>
                                <ChevronDown className={`w-4 h-4 text-slate-500 transition-transform ${activeMenu === 'tools_menu' ? 'rotate-180' : ''}`} />
                            </button>
                            {activeMenu === 'tools_menu' && (
                                <div className="absolute top-full left-0 right-0 mt-2 bg-slate-950 border border-white/10 rounded-2xl shadow-xl z-30 overflow-hidden animate-fade-in p-1">
                                    <button onClick={() => { onNavigate('smart_money', { tab: 'cashflow' }); setActiveMenu(null); }} className="w-full text-left px-4 py-3 text-[10px] font-bold text-slate-300 hover:bg-white/5 hover:text-white rounded-xl flex items-center gap-3 uppercase tracking-wider">
                                        <GitFork className="w-3 h-3 text-indigo-400" /> Cashflow Beta
                                    </button>
                                    <button onClick={() => { onNavigate('smart_money', { tab: 'sandbox' }); setActiveMenu(null); }} className="w-full text-left px-4 py-3 text-[10px] font-bold text-slate-300 hover:bg-white/5 hover:text-white rounded-xl flex items-center gap-3 uppercase tracking-wider">
                                        <Microscope className="w-3 h-3 text-amber-400" /> Predictive Sandbox
                                    </button>
                                    <button onClick={() => { onNavigate('smart_money', { tab: 'negotiator' }); setActiveMenu(null); }} className="w-full text-left px-4 py-3 text-[10px] font-bold text-slate-300 hover:bg-white/5 hover:text-white rounded-xl flex items-center gap-3 uppercase tracking-wider">
                                        <Handshake className="w-3 h-3 text-emerald-400" /> Bill Negotiator
                                    </button>
                                </div>
                            )}
                        </div>

                        {/* 3. Daily Action (Primary) */}
                        <button 
                            onClick={() => onNavigate('insights', { reportType: 'daily' })} 
                            className="w-full p-[1.625rem] bg-indigo-600 text-white rounded-3xl text-xs font-black uppercase tracking-widest shadow-xl shadow-indigo-500/20 hover:bg-indigo-500 transition-all border border-indigo-400/20 flex justify-between items-center group active:scale-95 transform"
                        >
                            <span className="flex items-center gap-3"><Zap className="w-5 h-5 text-white" /> Daily Action</span>
                            <ArrowUpRight className="w-5 h-5 text-white group-hover:translate-x-1 transition-transform" />
                        </button>

                        {/* 4. Investment Node */}
                        <button 
                            onClick={() => onNavigate('investment')} 
                            className="w-full p-5 bg-slate-900/40 border border-white/5 text-slate-300 rounded-3xl text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-widest flex justify-between items-center hover:bg-slate-800 hover:text-white transition-all shadow-sm group"
                        >
                            <span className="flex items-center gap-3"><TrendingUp className="w-4 h-4 text-emerald-500" /> Investment Node</span>
                            <ArrowUpRight className="w-4 h-4 text-slate-500 group-hover:text-white group-hover:translate-x-1 transition-transform" />
                        </button>
                    </div>

                    {/* Right Column: Credit Score Tracker (Span 1) */}
                    <div className="md:col-span-1 h-full glass-card rounded-[2.5rem] border border-white/5 bg-gradient-to-b from-slate-900/80 to-slate-950/80 p-1 flex flex-col relative overflow-hidden items-center text-center justify-center shadow-2xl">
                        {/* Inner Container for alignment */}
                        <div className="w-full h-full rounded-[2.2rem] border border-white/5 bg-[#020617]/50 flex flex-col items-center justify-center p-6">
                            <h3 className="text-[10px] font-black text-slate-500 uppercase tracking-widest mb-4 flex items-center gap-2">
                                <Gauge className="w-4 h-4" /> Credit Health
                            </h3>
                            <div className="flex-1 w-full flex items-center justify-center min-h-[140px]">
                                <CreditScoreGauge score={creditScore} onNavigate={onNavigate} />
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>

                {/* Recurring Bills - Redesigned Vertical Stack */}
                <div className="flex flex-col gap-4 flex-1 min-h-0">

                    {/* Box 1: Upcoming Bills */}
                    <div className="glass-card p-5 rounded-[2rem] border border-white/5 bg-slate-900/40 flex flex-col gap-4 relative overflow-hidden flex-1 min-h-[200px]">
                        <div className="flex items-center gap-2 mb-2">
                            <div className="p-2 bg-amber-500/10 rounded-lg text-amber-400 border border-amber-500/20">
                                <Clock className="w-4 h-4" />
                            </div>
                            <div>
                                <h3 className="text-xs font-black text-white uppercase tracking-widest">Upcoming Bills</h3>
                                <p className="text-[9px] text-slate-500 font-bold">Projected Outflows</p>
                            </div>
                        </div>

                        <div className="flex-1 overflow-y-auto custom-scrollbar space-y-3 pr-1">
                            {upcomingBills.length > 0 ? (
                                upcomingBills.map((bill, i) => (
                                    <div key={`up-${i}`} className="bg-slate-950/50 p-3 rounded-xl border border-white/5 flex items-center justify-between group hover:border-amber-500/30 transition-colors relative overflow-hidden">
                                        <div className="absolute bottom-0 left-0 h-0.5 bg-amber-500/20 w-full">
                                            <div className="h-full bg-amber-500" style={{ width: `${Math.max(0, 100 - (bill.daysLeft * 10))}%` }}></div>
                                        </div>
                                        <div className="flex items-center gap-3 relative z-10">
                                            <div className="w-8 h-8 rounded-lg bg-slate-900 flex items-center justify-center text-[10px] font-black text-slate-300 border border-white/5">
                                                {bill.merchant.charAt(0)}
                                            </div>
                                            <div>
                                                <div className="text-[11px] font-bold text-white group-hover:text-amber-400 transition-colors truncate max-w-[80px]">{bill.merchant}</div>
                                                <div className="text-[9px] font-bold text-slate-500 flex items-center gap-1">
                                                    {bill.daysLeft <= 0 ? 'Due Today' : `In ${bill.daysLeft} Days`}
                                                </div>
                                            </div>
                                        </div>
                                        <div className="text-right relative z-10">
                                            <div className="text-xs font-black text-white">{formatCurrency(bill.amount)}</div>
                                        </div>
                                    </div>
                                ))
                            ) : (
                                <div className="h-full flex flex-col items-center justify-center text-center opacity-40">
                                    <CheckCircle2 className="w-8 h-8 text-slate-500 mb-2" />
                                    <p className="text-[10px] font-bold text-slate-500 uppercase tracking-widest">No pending bills</p>
                                </div>
                            )}
                        </div>
                    </div>

                    {/* Box 2: Subscriptions */}
                    <div className="glass-card p-5 rounded-[2rem] border border-white/5 bg-slate-900/40 flex flex-col gap-4 relative overflow-hidden flex-1 min-h-[200px]">
                        <div className="flex items-center gap-2 mb-2">
                            <div className="p-2 bg-indigo-500/10 rounded-lg text-indigo-400 border border-indigo-500/20">
                                <Zap className="w-4 h-4" />
                            </div>
                            <div>
                                <h3 className="text-xs font-black text-white uppercase tracking-widest">Subscriptions</h3>
                                <p className="text-[9px] text-slate-500 font-bold">Active Recurring</p>
                            </div>
                        </div>

                        <div className="flex-1 overflow-y-auto custom-scrollbar space-y-3 pr-1">
                            {paidBills.length > 0 ? (
                                paidBills.map(bill => (
                                    <div key={bill.id} className="flex items-center justify-between p-3 rounded-xl bg-slate-950/30 hover:bg-slate-950/60 border border-transparent hover:border-indigo-500/20 transition-colors group">
                                        <div className="flex items-center gap-3">
                                            <div className="w-8 h-8 rounded-full bg-emerald-500/10 flex items-center justify-center text-emerald-500 border border-emerald-500/20">
                                                <Check className="w-3 h-3" />
                                            </div>
                                            <div className="flex flex-col">
                                                <span className="text-[11px] font-bold text-slate-300 group-hover:text-white transition-colors truncate max-w-[100px]">{bill.merchant}</span>
                                                <span className="text-[8px] text-slate-500 font-bold uppercase">Paid {new Date(bill.date).toLocaleDateString('en-US', { month: 'short', day: 'numeric' })}</span>
                                            </div>
                                        </div>
                                        <span className="text-[11px] font-bold text-slate-200">{formatCurrency(bill.amount)}</span>
                                    </div>
                                ))
                            ) : (
                                <div className="h-full flex flex-col items-center justify-center text-center opacity-40">
                                    <Calendar className="w-8 h-8 text-slate-500 mb-2" />
                                    <p className="text-[10px] font-bold text-slate-500 uppercase tracking-widest">No active subs</p>
                                </div>
                            )}
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>

            </div>
        </div>

        {/* Scan Confirmation Modal */}
        {showScanConfirm && (
            <div className="fixed inset-0 z-[150] flex items-center justify-center p-4 bg-black/90 backdrop-blur-md animate-fade-in">
                <div className="bg-[#0f172a] border border-white/10 rounded-[2.5rem] w-full max-w-sm p-8 shadow-2xl relative animate-slide-up">
                    <div className="w-16 h-16 bg-indigo-500/20 rounded-2xl flex items-center justify-center mx-auto mb-6 border border-indigo-500/30">
                        <Zap className="w-8 h-8 text-indigo-400 animate-pulse" />
                    </div>
                    <h3 className="text-xl font-black text-white mb-2 text-center uppercase tracking-tight">Initialize Audit?</h3>
                    <p className="text-sm text-slate-400 mb-8 text-center leading-relaxed">This will execute a full neural scan of your capital vectors to provide strategic intelligence. <br/><span className="text-indigo-400 font-bold">1 Token will be utilized.</span></p>
                    <div className="grid grid-cols-2 gap-4">
                        <button onClick={() => setShowScanConfirm(false)} className="py-4 bg-slate-800 text-slate-400 font-black rounded-xl text-[10px] uppercase tracking-widest hover:text-white transition-colors">Abort</button>
                        <button onClick={handleProceedWithScan} className="py-4 bg-indigo-600 text-white font-black rounded-xl text-[10px] uppercase tracking-widest shadow-lg shadow-indigo-500/20 hover:bg-indigo-500 transition-all flex items-center justify-center gap-2">
                            <Check className="w-4 h-4" /> Proceed
                        </button>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        )}

        {/* Edit Transaction Modal via Dashboard */}
        {editingTransaction && onUpdateTransaction && (
            <AddTransactionModal 
                onClose={() => setEditingTransaction(null)} 
                onAdd={(updatedTx) => { onUpdateTransaction(updatedTx); setEditingTransaction(null); }}
                accounts={accounts}
                userPlan={userPlan}
                formatCurrency={formatCurrency}
                scanUsage={0} // Dashboard editing doesn't affect scan usage logic
                currency={currency}
                initialData={editingTransaction}
            />
        )}
    </div>
  );
};

export default Dashboard;

payload.text:
I see the update! While the axis numbers aren't getting chopped off anymore, the chart now looks like it's "floating" in too much empty space, and the X-axis (the dates) is still a bit of a mess.

The "breathing room" fix actually created a new problem: the chart area itself shrunk to accommodate the large margins, making the data look tiny.

### Why it still doesn't look "Good"

1. **Over-Corrected Margins:** The `left: 30` in the chart plus the `p-10` on the card is pushing the Y-axis way too far into the center.
2. **The X-Axis Clutter:** Even with `interval={2}`, the numbers 1, 4, 7... are too close together because the chart doesn't have enough horizontal width to breathe.
3. **The "Dead Zone":** The huge gap between "Spend Trajectory" and the actual graph makes the card feel disconnected.

---

### The "Final Boss" Fix

To make this look professional, we need to use **`tickFormatter`** for the dates and pull the margins back just a bit. This keeps the labels clear but lets the graph fill the card.

**Replace your `XAxis` and `YAxis` blocks with this refined version:**

```tsx
{/* FIX: Reduced left margin slightly, increased bottom to allow for the 'dy' offset */}
<ComposedChart data={lineChartData} margin={{ top: 10, right: 10, left: 15, bottom: 20 }}>

    <XAxis 
        dataKey="day" 
        stroke="#475569" 
        fontSize={10} 
        tickLine={false} 
        axisLine={false} 
        dy={10} 
        tick={{ fill: '#64748b' }}
        /* FIX: Only show every 5th day (1, 6, 11...) to stop the crowding */
        interval={4} 
        /* FIX: Format the day so it says "Day 1" or just "1" clearly */
        tickFormatter={(value) => `${value}`} 
    />

    <YAxis 
        stroke="#475569" 
        fontSize={10} 
        tickLine={false} 
        axisLine={false} 
        /* FIX: Reduced width to 50; 70 was overkill and pushed the chart too far right */
        width={50} 
        dx={-5}
        tickFormatter={(val) => isPrivacyMode ? '•••' : `$${val}`}
        tick={{ fill: '#64748b' }}
    />

```

### What this actually changes:

* **The 5-Day Rule:** Instead of `interval={2}`, use `interval={4}`. This shows days 1, 6, 11, 16, 21, 26. It gives the dates massive breathing room.
* **The "Goldilocks" Width:** Bumping the Y-Axis width down from `70` to `50` pulls the graph back toward the left, making it feel more balanced.
* **Padding Balance:** Change the card back to `p-8` instead of `p-10`. It gives you more "ink" for the actual chart and less wasted dark space.

